// 尾随 `;`：方法调用无值成功且副作用生效；多语句单行只剥尾随那个；赋值不撞 `;;`；裸表达式仍打印值。
namespace Z42ScriptingTests;

using Std.Scripting;
using Std.Harness;

[Test]
void test_trailing_semicolon() {
    ScriptState s = Script.Create();
    Assert.Equal("List", _step(s, "var l = new List<int>();"));
    Assert.Equal("ok", _step(s, "l.Add(5);"));
    Assert.Equal("1", _step(s, "l.Count"));
    Assert.Equal("ok", _step(s, "l.Add(6); l.Add(7);"));
    Assert.Equal("3", _step(s, "l.Count"));
    Assert.Equal("1", _step(s, "var n = 1;"));
    Assert.Equal("ok", _step(s, "n = 5;"));
    Assert.Equal("5", _step(s, "n"));
    Assert.Equal("7", _step(s, "n + 2;"));
    Assert.Equal("10", _step(s, "n * 2"));
}
